# ==============================================================================
# Cake Shoppee - Geocoding API Configuration (For 100% Exact Rooftop Addresses)
# ==============================================================================

# OPTION 1 (RECOMMENDED - Most Accurate in India): Google Maps Geocoding API
# - Provides 100% exact doorstep house numbers, building names, and Telugu street names
# - Free tier: $200 free credit every month (~40,000 free address requests/month)
# - How to get key in 2 minutes:
#   1. Visit https://console.cloud.google.com/
#   2. Create a project and enable "Geocoding API"
#   3. Create an API Key under Credentials and paste it here:
GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=

# OPTION 2 (100% FREE NO CREDIT CARD REQUIRED): LocationIQ API
# - Free tier: 5,000 free requests every day
# - How to get key in 1 minute:
#   1. Visit https://locationiq.com/
#   2. Sign up with email (no credit card needed)
#   3. Copy your API Access Token and paste it here:
LOCATIONIQ_API_KEY=
